## Model card

No primary-source model card, API ID or checkpoint for the exact Qwen3.5 Flash Lite identity was verified. Release, architecture, modalities, context, output limit and pricing remain unverified for this exact label. No Zen Free ID established.

The [official Alibaba model roster](https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/text-generation-model/) names `qwen3.5-flash`, `qwen3.5-plus` and explicit open-weight sizes; it does not establish a Flash Lite variant. The [Flash documentation](https://docs.modelstudio.console.alibabacloud.com/en/model-studio/qwen3-5-flash) maps ordinary Flash to `qwen3.5-flash-2026-02-23`, with 1M context and image/video input. These are neighboring-model facts, not verified specifications for Lite. The [official price list](https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/model-pricing) similarly lists ordinary Flash and its dated snapshot, not a distinct Lite model.

